Description: Ladybird with your tabs down the side and Bitwarden built in
 SuperAwesomeMagical Browser is Ladybird, the independent browser, set up the
 SuperAwesomeMagical way: tabs down the left side, Lexend for the interface and
 for pages, Ecosia for searches, ads and trackers blocked, a start page with a
 big clock over the northern lights, and Bitwarden in the toolbar to fill in
 your logins.
 .
 It carries its own build of Ladybird (with Bitwarden added) and Bitwarden's
 command-line client, and runs in a profile of its own.
